---
export const prerender = false;
import {communityAccess} from '../lib/community-access';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/venue-workspace.css';
const { isAuthenticated, userId } = Astro.locals.auth();
if (!isAuthenticated) return Astro.redirect('/sign-in/');
const onlineTest = import.meta.env.MODE === 'online-test';
const access = await communityAccess(userId,Astro.locals);
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control', 'private, no-store');
---
<BaseLayout title="Your account | Artists Are Jerks" noindex><main class="venue-workspace"><p>Development testing</p><h1>Your account</h1><p>The account panel above identifies the AAJ login currently in use and provides the AAJ sign-out control. Cloudflare Access is a separate outer gate for this private test site.</p>{access ? <section class="card"><h2>Your access</h2><p>Your workspace permissions are assigned by an administrator.</p>{access.artistId && <p><a href={`/prototype/workspace/member/?artist=${encodeURIComponent(access.artistId)}`}>Open your artist workspace →</a></p>}{access.venueId && <p><a href={`/prototype/venues/workspace/?venue=${encodeURIComponent(access.venueId)}`}>Open your venue workspace →</a></p>}{access.administrator && <><h3>Administrator tools</h3><ul><li><a href="/prototype/admin/accounts/">Assign account access →</a></li><li><a href="/prototype/admin/inbox/">Application inbox →</a></li><li><a href="/prototype/admin/venues/">Review venue applications →</a></li><li><a href="/prototype/storage/">Storage settings →</a></li></ul></>}</section> : <section class="card"><h2>Nothing here yet</h2><p>This account doesn’t have an artist or venue page. Want to show your work here?</p><p><a href="/join/?kind=artist">Ask to join as an artist →</a></p><p><a href="/join/venue/">Or introduce a venue →</a></p></section>}<p class="notice">{onlineTest ? 'Private online test site. Access is protected by Cloudflare Access; artist and venue workspaces are assigned to individual accounts. Changes use separate test storage.' : 'Local development only. Artist and venue workspace access is restricted by account assignment. Online testing requires a separate development deployment.'}</p></main></BaseLayout>
